build/
dist/
# …EXCEPT the vendored CodeMirror bundle, which is a committed build product on
# purpose: it is what lets a clean checkout, the release script and CI build the
# plugin with no node installed. `dist/` above matches at every level, so
# `Editor/dist` was being ignored and the editor surface existed only in the
# working tree of whoever last ran `make editor`.
!Editor/dist/
*.xcodeproj/
.DS_Store
Editor/node_modules/
# The screenshot helpers, compiled on demand from their `.swift` sources beside
# them. Both were committed as ~100 KB Mach-O binaries and re-committed on every
# rebuild; the sources are the deliverable, the binaries are a cache.
scripts/.preview
scripts/.window-bounds
# Local junk that was once committed: SwiftPM scratch and agent worktrees.
.build/
.claude/worktrees/
